WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:03.440
That concludes our true baptism.

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.910
Please have a seat.

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:08.400
The tea will be ready soon.

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:14.360
Cardinal Hohenheim...

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:21.520
I would like to express my sincere 
gratitude to you for inviting one

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.790
as young as I to partake in a true baptism.

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:29.600
I have heard that such a baptism 
is a great honor that is typically

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.870
bestowed only upon the chosen,

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:33.950
so I could not be more grateful that you

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.970
have granted me such an honor.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:39.370
This is merely a trifle,

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:41.180
but please accept my offering.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:49.300
Baronet Baumeister,
may God grant you protection.

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:56.240
Yes, enter.

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:00.660
Please excuse me.

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:09.400
This is my granddaughter.

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:13.340
Go on, introduce yourself.

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:18.890
I am Elise Katarina von Hohenheim.

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:22.850
I'm Wendelin von Benno Baumeister.

00:01:27.190 --> 00:01:29.230
So you've noticed, have you?

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:32.460
She possesses magic power, doesn't she?

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:35.920
Yes, she can use holy healing magic.

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:38.650
Healing? That's incredible.

00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:41.760
The only holy magic 
I can use is purification.

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:44.870
Oh, no, it's impressive 
that you can use any all.

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:48.580
So do you heal the wounded 
here at this church?

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:49.540
Yes.

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:54.480
We have several other nuns in training who 
perform charity and distribute food, as well,

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:58.760
so many of the people call 
her the "Saint" Hohenheim.

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.520
That's wonderful.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:04.220
So she'll become a member of the clergy?

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:11.150
Personally, I would prefer for her 
to get married, like a normal girl.

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:15.370
Elise is quite beautiful, though.

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:17.400
Wouldn't there be competition for her?

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:20.810
To be honest, there are many 
families asking for her.

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:24.100
Oh? Then maybe I should join the running, too.

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:29.810
Oh? You would take my 
granddaughter to be your wife?

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:31.620
I'm still underage,

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:33.400
so it would just be an engagement.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:37.190
That's true. Elise is also only 12,

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:42.600
so what would you think of having the 
proper wedding once you're of age?

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:47.160
I guess that means I'd be bidding the 
bachelor life farewell in three years.

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:50.260
Then it'd finally be time 
to pay the piper, huh?

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:04.240
All right, then, so it shall be.

00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:06.160
So it shall be?

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.410
Yes, so it shall be.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:13.470
Huh? I thought we were just 
having a chat about business...

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:19.970
<i>One minute after I met her, we were engaged.</i>

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:49.120
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:49.120
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:49.120
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:49.120
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:49.120
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:49.120
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:49.120
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:49.120
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:55.520
Episode 5
Political Marriage?! Are You Kidding Me?!

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:55.980
Inviting him over for a true baptism and 
securing the engagement right there...

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.690
Perhaps I was too pushy?

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:02.400
I believe it was very fitting of you, my lord.

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:06.920
But I do wonder what we're going to say to

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:10.600
Duke Bleichröder, the Lord 
of the Baumeister family.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:14.070
That is why I first obtained 
His Majesty's pledge.

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:18.660
Even the Duke won't be able to object 
when I have His Majesty's backing.

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:20.460
Impressive, my lord.

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:27.060
More importantly, look at this offering.

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:29.860
It couldn't be more unbelievable.

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:36.820
For a young boy, he has a good understanding 
of the power the church wields.

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:40.840
I guess using magic isn't 
all he's capable of.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:44.080
The Hohenheim family holds 
the rank of viscount,

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:50.980
so you always said the man to marry 
Lady Elise must be at least a Baron,

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:55.490
but now I understand why you 
would choose Baronet Baumeister,

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:59.380
even if it took me some time to see it.

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:03.340
Your judgment is quite sound, my lord.

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:05.620
For now, at least.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:14.120
I can't believe you went to get 
baptized and came back engaged.

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:17.670
And to "Saint" Hohenheim of all people.

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:21.400
Lineage and a good personality—she's perfect!

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.960
But it happened just a minute after I met her.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:30.610
Is that really enough to determine the 
partner I'm supposed to share a long life with?

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:34.350
But isn't that just how marriage is?

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:38.050
Yeah. It's unusual to even have 
one minute with them first.

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:42.920
No, no! You're supposed to spend 
more time cultivating love and...

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:46.980
We didn't meet our wives until 
the very day we were wed.

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:47.630
Huh?

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:50.380
It was the same for my parents, too.

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:53.580
I think it was the same for 
Brother Kurt and Amalie.

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:56.660
Really?

00:06:57.280 --> 00:06:58.060
Yes.

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:00.700
Okay, now, close your eyes.

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:05.090
<i>I see. There's no such thing</i>

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:07.340
<i>as romantic marriages for nobles.</i>

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.160
Hey, look at that.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:16.910
So... what's the deal with this disguise?

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:21.000
I mean, you said you wanted to 
see the sights of the capital without

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.630
being noticed by the guy who 
wanted to be your retainer.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:25.220
I know...

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:28.550
And no one is noticing who I am, but...

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.290
Just enjoy yourself!

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:34.260
Maybe buy a souvenir for the wife.

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:37.950
Wife, huh?

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:39.490
I'm sure she's thinking,

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:44.020
"I'm marrying the Dragon Slayer? 
Lucky me!" right about now.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:46.640
You really think she is?

00:07:46.640 --> 00:07:49.650
I mean, you said she was 
smiling the whole time, right?

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:53.130
But that was in front of her 
grandfather. Who knows...

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:56.230
what she really thinks deep down?

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:13.320
That's the guy who keeps 
asking to be my retainer!

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:16.930
Don't worry. He'll never realize it's you.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.460
Sir Baumeister!

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:23.890
You're dressed quite comically,

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:26.630
but those teeth belong to Sir Baumeister,

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:28.690
so I noticed right away!

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:33.570
Um, could you keep the volume down?

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:36.530
I knew it! That man is the Dragon Slayer!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:39.490
Sir Baumeister! Please make me your retainer!

00:08:40.810 --> 00:08:41.950
Here they come! Here they come!

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.580
Then behold!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.860
The third form of my Spinning Spear!

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:55.240
I can't believe you can't see any of 
the sights when it's summer break.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.830
I feel bad for you.

00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:00.540
Why don't you actually hire a retainer?

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:05.020
Then you could have them turn 
down all those asking to be one.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:08.850
Oh, then how about I be your retainer?

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:10.580
Huh? Oh...

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:12.230
Let's go with that, then.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:13.940
For real?

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:16.610
Hold on, are you serious?

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:19.370
Huh? Wait, wait... What?

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:23.080
Well, I'm heading out for a bit,
 so I'll see you later.

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:31.370
Um, did I just become a retainer?

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:33.260
I did, right?

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:34.520
Yeah.

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:36.470
Congratulations, Erwin.

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:39.100
I did it.

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:06.790
Baronet Baumeister?

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:10.500
What are you doing there?

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:31.740
I'm sorry about that.

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:33.690
It's all right.

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:40.160
I bought these earlier. 
I thought we could share them.

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:42.400
Huh?!

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:47.380
They're all crushed...

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:50.750
Um, the truth is, I wanted to talk.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.750
In that case, let's go down.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.410
I'll prepare us some tea.

00:10:54.410 --> 00:10:55.050
Oh...

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.390
I meant just the two of us, if possible.

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:04.390
Very well.

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:12.920
It's about our engagement this morning...

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.260
I wanted...

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:22.320
I wanted to ask you how 
you felt about all this.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:26.790
I think it's a nice arrangement.

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:28.850
A nice arrangement?

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:30.500
What do you mean?

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:33.960
I can see why my grandfather has chosen you.

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:38.670
But you don't know anything about me, do you?

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:41.440
There isn't a soul in the capital

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:45.890
who doesn't know about the heroics of 
Baronet Baumeister, the Dragon Slayer.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:49.460
The... heroics?

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:53.300
I'm happy that I'll become
 the wife of such a man.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.620
Then I'm glad.

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:08.140
I can't believe Er became Well's retainer.

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:12.540
All while we were out 
buying fancy clothes, too.

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:20.180
Though I kind of thought something like this 
might happen after Well became a baronet.

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:22.010
There's still time!

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.920
Let's have Well hire us, too!

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:28.770
I see. So you're hoping 
to be his retainers, too.

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:34.480
It's my job to tell you to take a hike,

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:36.040
but okay, roger that.

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:38.440
I'll put in a good word for you with Well.

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:41.840
Thanks.

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:43.780
I'm glad, though.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:48.960
I always wanted to have juniors.

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:52.080
Wait, wait!

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.480
So we'll be his juniors?

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:55.420
No way!

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:57.970
If he tries to treat me like I'm beneath him,

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:00.370
I'll beat him to death on 
my first day of the job!

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:02.400
I'll murder him by morning!

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:04.050
But at this rate...

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:07.870
C'mon, isn't there anything 
we can do to get above him?!

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:12.060
Hello? Is there anyone here who 
could help me peel potatoes?

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:13.560
Yes!

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:17.940
I'll help peel them, too.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:20.460
Iina!

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:22.300
That's it!

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:24.810
That's how we get above Er!

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:29.280
You don't mean...

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:30.000
Yeah!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:34.140
We aim to be his wives!

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:35.970
But there's Elise...

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:38.810
So we aim to be concubines!

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:44.670
That's true. It's common for 
nobles to have concubines.

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:48.290
Since we're daughters of military 
retainers, it might be impossible

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.090
for us to be official wives,

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:52.390
but we can still become concubines!

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:54.770
It might be possible.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:56.400
Then, once we're with him,

00:13:56.400 --> 00:14:01.420
we can use our privileged position 
to work Er like a cart horse!

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:07.240
I'm home.

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:12.720
Okay, time to commence Operation 
Concubine Seduction!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:16.030
Operation Concubine Seduction?

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:17.550
Just watch.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.840
Dinner is ready!

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:43.740
Okay.

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:03.520
What are you doing? You just bought that.

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:07.510
I'm making a new outfit for 
Operation Concubine Seduction II.

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:12.970
You're remarkable, Louise.

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:16.870
I can't be that aggressive 
about things like this.

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:19.180
I can't, either.

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:23.440
But if I manage to become Well's concubine,

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:27.340
then one day, I might be able to 
open a school to teach my own style.

00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:32.620
Then my family might finally recognize me.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:36.610
I'm sorry.

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:40.060
You're right. I'll do my best, too.

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:41.750
There, all done!

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.490
This one's yours, Iina!

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:46.760
Huh? There's one for me?

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:49.050
Thank you!

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:50.420
Here, try it on!

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:51.180
Okay!

00:15:58.080 --> 00:15:59.360
Absolutely not.

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:00.940
Huh? Why not?

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:02.210
It covers what it needs to!

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:04.000
It reveals nearly everything!

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:05.820
Huh? But this is what mine's like.

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:08.810
That's just a few strings! No, threads!

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:11.660
Your invitation.

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:18.540
To have dinner with Elise tomorrow night.

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:20.460
All right...

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:38.560
Tonight, we have prepared a course
of several original dishes

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:43.810
inspired by the achievements of "Saint" 
Hohenheim and the Dragon Slayer.

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:46.240
We hope you enjoy them.

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:53.990
It's sea bream.

00:16:57.650 --> 00:16:59.700
Yes, it's sea bream.

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:01.160
It's good, isn't it?

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:03.370
Yes, it's good.

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:04.830
Right?

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:13.670
It was good, wasn't it?

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:16.130
Yes, it was good.

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:18.550
Then I suppose I should...

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:21.760
Sir Baumeister...

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:24.210
This is your first date.

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:27.810
Why not be a gentleman and give 
her something to commemorate it?

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:29.500
Commemorate?

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:34.740
Dragon Slayer and "Saint" Hohenheim...

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:41.910
Today we have prepared this selection of 
items to suit you two and your betrothal.

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:45.180
He meant an engagement ring, huh?

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:51.250
By the way, how much are these?

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:55.630
Well, they range from 10 to 50 gold coins.

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:58.650
<i>So one to five million yen...</i>

00:17:58.650 --> 00:18:00.540
<i>That's nobility for you.</i>

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:05.020
<i>Even though they're so 
ostentatious and unrefined...</i>

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:09.940
Um, Baronet Baumeister...

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:14.960
You don't have to buy me 
something this expensive.

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:17.030
It's all right.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:21.180
I received a substantial reward 
for defeating that bone dragon.

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:31.100
This is...

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:40.430
An engagement ring is something that 
"Saint" Hohenheim will wear frequently.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:42.540
I think that one might be too plain.

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:49.650
Still, I'll take this one.

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:51.060
As you wish.

00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:52.940
How much is it?

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:56.730
This one will cost 300 gold coins.

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:59.100
<i>300 million yen?!</i>

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:02.140
It's specially crafted using a magic stone.

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:04.660
Still, that's...

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:08.330
I'll take it.

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:10.680
Thank you very much for your purchase.

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:26.310
Baronet Baumeister...

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:27.370
Yes?

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:34.150
The truth is that you were able to see 
that this ring had a magic stone, isn't it?

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:35.060
Huh?

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:38.630
According to the shopkeeper we just spoke to,

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:43.570
this ring is capable of 
storing great magic power.

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:46.240
So wearing this would surely

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:51.790
allow me to be useful to you in the future.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.850
So understanding all of that, you...

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:58.500
No, to be honest, I didn't 
realize that was a magic stone.

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:02.560
Then why did you choose this one?

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:03.220
Huh?

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:09.150
Well, I just chose a ring 
I thought would look good on you.

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:14.350
Oh, was it too plain?

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:16.400
No...

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:20.640
Oh, that's a relief.

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:25.280
Anyway, you're incredible, Elise.

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:29.450
I mean, these past few days,

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:34.390
I've been feeling the pressure of suddenly 
being called a hero or the Dragon Slayer.

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:38.080
Pressure, you say?

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:43.330
Even today, part of me is wondering 
if I'm actually acting like a hero.

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:47.420
I'm not even that brave.

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:53.910
But you've been called a saint
ever since you were little, right?

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:56.600
No, I wasn't...

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.500
It must have been hard.

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:00.510
Oh, right.

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:04.550
They said this ring would glow 
when you put magic into it, right?

00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:05.830
Can I see it a moment?

00:21:22.820 --> 00:21:24.250
Incredible...

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:34.790
So?

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:38.270
What did you think of that boy?

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:42.480
He's a bit hard to discern.

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:52.140
Most men before him have treated 
Elise as "Saint" Hohenheim,

00:21:52.140 --> 00:21:57.510
but Sir Baumeister treated 
her like a normal young girl.

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:01.390
I have no idea what he's thinking.

00:22:03.370 --> 00:22:05.190
<i>That sea bream we had earlier...</i>

00:22:05.750 --> 00:22:08.980
<i>It would have been great 
with some soy sauce.</i>
